  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "第5题(14分)高温条件下反应机理的研究一直是化学反应动力学的基本课题,1956年的诺⻉尔化学奖获得者在该领域做出过杰出的贡献。科研工作者研究了1000 K下丙酮的热分解反应并提出了如下反应历程:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{COCH} _ {3} \\xrightarrow {k _ {1}} \\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\cdot + \\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{CO} \\cdot"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "E _ {a} (1) = 351 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{CO} \\cdot \\xrightarrow {k _ {2}} \\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\cdot + \\mathrm{CO}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "E _ {a} (2) = 42 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\cdot + \\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{COCH} _ {3} \\xrightarrow {k _ {3}} \\mathrm{CH} _ {4} + \\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{COCH} _ {2} \\cdot"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "E _ {a} (3) = 63 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{COCH} _ {2} \\cdot \\xrightarrow {k _ {4}} \\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\cdot + \\mathrm{CH} _ {2} \\mathrm{CO}\\tag{4}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "E _ {a} (4) = 200 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\cdot + \\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{COCH} _ {2} \\cdot \\xrightarrow {k _ {5}} \\mathrm{C} _ {2} \\mathrm{H} _ {5} \\mathrm{COCH} _ {3}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "E _ {a} (5) = 21 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "5-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "上述历程是根据两个平行反应而提出的,请写出反应方程式。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-001760"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "5-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "实验测得1000K下热分解反应对丙酮为一级反应,试推出反应的速率方程。提示:1消耗丙酮的主要基元步骤是反应(3);2可忽略各基元反应指前因子的影响。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-001761"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "5-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "根据5-2推出的速率方程,计算表观活化能。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-001762"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "5-4",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "分解产物中 \\mathrm { C H _ { 4 } } 可以和水蒸气反应制备H<sub>2</sub>:"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-001763"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\\mathrm{CH} _ {4} (\\mathrm{g}) + \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} (\\mathrm{g}) \\rightarrow 3 \\mathrm{H} _ {2} (\\mathrm{g}) + \\mathrm{CO} (\\mathrm{g})"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "试根据下表数据计算该反应在298K时 \\Delta _ { r } G _ { m } ^ { \\ominus } 和平衡常数 K ^ { \\ominus } ,并指出平衡常数随温度的变化趋势。"
    },
